<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Nganggo Variabel lan Tandha Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170654982105">Upamane arep nggawe asil ping-pingan saka sangang faktor, saben faktore padha karo 2. Bisa ditulis dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Nulis kaya ngene kuwi repot lan angel ngetung ana pira angka 2, mula nganggo eksponen. Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bisa ditulis dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bisa ditulis dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Ing wujud aljabar kaya <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> angka 2 jenenge <emphasis effect="italics">wilangan dhasar (basis)</emphasis> lan angka 3 jenenge <emphasis effect="italics">eksponen</emphasis>. Eksponen nuduhake ana pira faktor sing saben-saben padha karo wilangan dhasar.</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655219218" alt="Ana angka loro karo angka telu sing ditulis ing sisih tengen ndhuwur, jenenge superskrip. Ana panah nuding angka loro kanthi tulisan “wilangan dhasar”, lan panah liyane nuding angka telu ing ndhuwur kanthi tulisan “eksponen”. Tegese, gawe asil ping-pingan saka telung faktor sing saben-saben padha karo 2, yaiku 2 ping 2 ping 2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_003_img_new.jpg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id1166420392829">Tulisan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “loro pangkat telu” utawa “loro kubik”.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654953415">Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">tulisan pangkat</emphasis> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">tulisan dawa</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655107718">
<title>Tulisan Pangkat</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655213989"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> tegese asil ping-pingan saka faktor sing saben-saben padha karo <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>, kanthi cacah faktor <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>, lan n kudu wilangan bulat positif.</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655111941" alt="Ana a karo n sing ditulis ing sisih tengen ndhuwur minangka superskrip. Ana panah nuding a kanthi tulisan “wilangan dhasar”, lan panah liyane nuding n ing ndhuwur kanthi tulisan “eksponen”. Ing ngisore ana persamaan a superskrip n padha karo a ping a ping a ping elipsis ping a. Iki nuduhake faktor a sing dipingake, cacah faktore n, nanging nilai n durung ditemtokake. Ana tandha kurung ing ngisor faktor-faktor a mau kanthi tulisan “n faktor”.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_004_img_new.jpg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id1170655228836">Wujud Aljabar <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> pangkat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654937018">Senajan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> pangkat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>”, biasane diwaca:</para>
<list id="fs-id1166424875923" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> kuadrat”</item>
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> kubik”</item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id1170655195218">Mengko bakal cetha apa sebabe <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> duwe jeneng mligi.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655112606"><link target-id="fs-id1170654954100" /> nuduhake carane maca sawetara wujud aljabar sing nganggo eksponen.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170654954100" aria-label="Tabel iki ana limang larik lan rong kolom. Larik paling ndhuwur isine judhul kolom. Kolom kapisan tulisane &quot;Wujud Aljabar&quot; lan kolom kapindho &quot;Nganggo Tembung-tembung&quot;. Larik kapindho isine 7 superskrip 2 ing kolom kapisan lan &quot;7 pangkat loro utawa 7 kuadrat&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik sabanjure isine 5 superskrip 3 ing kolom kapisan lan &quot;5 pangkat telu utawa 5 kubik&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik sabanjure isine 9 superskrip 4 ing kolom kapisan lan &quot;9 pangkat papat&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik paling ngisor isine 12 superskrip 5 ing kolom kapisan lan &quot;12 pangkat lima&quot; ing kolom kapindho.">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top">Wujud Aljabar</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Nganggo Tembung-tembung</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">7 pangkat loro utawa 7 kuadrat</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">5 pangkat telu utawa 5 kubik</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">9 pangkat papat</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pangkat lima</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170655121051"><exercise id="fs-id1170655121053">
<problem id="fs-id1170654954435">
<para id="fs-id1170654954437">Gawe luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655003298">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-958" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Cara ngetung nilai wujud pangkat 3^4, langkah mbaka langkah.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry> </entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen kabeh faktor sing dipingake.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna saka kiwa menyang tengen.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna.</entry>
    <entry>81</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170655196165" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655197165">
<problem id="fs-id1170655197167">
<para id="fs-id1170655102365">Gawe luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654954209">
<para id="fs-id1170654954211"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 125 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655102894" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655194687">
<problem id="fs-id1170655194690">
<para id="fs-id1170655025314">Gawe luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655114557">
<para id="fs-id1170655114560"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 49 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>
